{"version":1,"content":"<p>台積電高雄楠梓廠今天下午發生重大工業安全事故，4名男性工人施工時隨鋼梁從高處墜落，分送3家醫院搶救，3人到院前已無呼吸心跳（OHCA）。</p><p>南部科學園區管理局證實，全案已釀3死1重傷，另1名傷者急救後轉入加護病房救治。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T14:40:58.150768+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T14:03:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T07:17:41.357471+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T14:38:14.661226+00:00","content_hash":"b5cc3b26817c3c6e12d7b649afb468e0609d89baee3fabd5be8f3905845450c8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}